" end="00:18.480">curious</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.230" end="00:23.520"><span begin="00:19.230" end="00:19.620">What's </span><span begin="00:19.620" end="00:20.130">on </span><span begin="00:20.130" end="00:20.730">your </span><span begin="00:20.730" end="00:21.750">mind</span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:23.520">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.520" end="00:25.920"><span begin="00:23.520" end="00:23.730">Cause </span><span begin="00:23.730" end="00:23.970">what's </span><span begin="00:23.970" end="00:24.150">on </span><span begin="00:24.150" end="00:24.780">mine's </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:24.870">a </span><span begin="00:24.870" end="00:25.260">dirty </span><span begin="00:25.260" end="00:25.920">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.950" end="00:28.380"><span begin="00:25.950" end="00:26.160">Why </span><span begin="00:26.160" end="00:26.430">so </span><span begin="00:26.430" end="00:27.660">serious</span><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:28.380">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.380" end="00:32.730"><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:28.740">Baby </span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:28.830">the </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.940">stars </span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:31.110">above </span><span begin="00:31.110" end="00:31.230">will </span><span begin="00:31.230" end="00:32.280">light </span><span begin="00:32.280" end="00:32.400">the </span><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.730">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.000" end="00:37.440"><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.330">Just </span><span begin="00:33.330" end="00:33.450">take </span><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.540">my </span><span begin="00:33.540" end="00:34.680">hand </span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:34.770">and </span><span begin="00:34.770" end="00:35.760">hear </span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:35.910">the </span><span begin="00:35.910" end="00:37.020">words </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.080